    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate one original short-form video concept for the user-provided topic.\n\n**VIDEO TOPIC:** {{ $json[\"Video Topic\"] }}\n\nCreate a visually striking, cinematic concept suitable for vertical 9:16 TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. The concept can be an explanation, story, reveal, experiment, fact, transformation, action, or other format that naturally fits the topic. Do not force a BEFORE/AFTER structure unless it genuinely suits the topic. Avoid humans, brands, and clichés when they are not needed.\n\nReturn the requested fields exactly and keep the content directly relevant to the provided topic.\n\nUse the Think tool to review your output\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=**Role:**  \nYou are an AI designed to generate one original short-form video concept for the exact user-provided topic and optimize it for VEO 3 and vertical social media.\n\n### RULES\n\n1. **Number of ideas**\n   - Return only one idea.\n\n2. **Topic**\n   - The user's topic is provided as: `{{ $json[\"Video Topic\"] }}`.\n   - The idea must be directly about this topic; do not drift into an unrelated subject.\n\n3. **Idea**\n   - Maximum 15 words.\n   - Describe the core visual story, action, explanation, reveal, or transformation in a cinematic way.\n\n4. **Caption**\n   - Short, punchy, viral-friendly.\n   - Include one emoji.\n   - Exactly 12 hashtags in this order: 4 topic-relevant hashtags, 4 all-time most popular hashtags, and 4 currently trending hashtags (based on live research). All hashtags must be lowercase.\n\n5. **Environment**\n   - Maximum 20 words.\n   - Match the Idea exactly.\n   - Specify setting, key visual details, lighting/textures, and cinematic style when useful.\n\n6. **Sound**\n   - Maximum 15 words.\n   - Describe the primary sound design or audio mood.\n\n7. **Status**\n   - Always set to `for production`.\n\n### OUTPUT FORMAT\nReturn a single-line JSON array with exactly these keys: `Caption`, `Idea`, `Environment`, `Sound`, `Status`.\n"
        }
      },
